sentences.text:
(i) If the petitioners will confine/limit their prayer only to set aside the award passed by the first respondent/Arbitrator, then the issue of paying ad valorem Court fee will not arise;
(ii) The petitioners are permitted to represent the papers before the learned Principal District Judge, Cuddalore within 30 days from the receipt of a copy of this order,
after making the necessary amendment to the prayer.

